00:19:44.961 --> 00:19:46.949
So, this is right up our alley.


00:19:47.429 --> 00:19:51.992
They hit 60 fields in the county.
You seen anything like this before?


00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:54.048
No, not like this.


00:19:54.401 --> 00:19:57.006
