00:20:28.621 --> 00:20:30.230
Yeah, I bet they do.


00:20:31.525 --> 00:20:33.231
You say you caught a live one?


00:20:35.172 --> 00:20:37.951
UTAH


00:20:43.088 --> 00:20:45.030
Okay, let it out slow.


00:20:46.657 --> 00:20:47.919
- Got it?
- Yeah.


00:20:48.625 --> 00:20:49.900
Easy!


