00:24:29.281 --> 00:24:30.542
Yeah.


00:24:30.626 --> 00:24:33.787
You know why I'm here?
It's quiet. I'm done with all of that.


00:24:33.871 --> 00:24:35.372
Are you? Okay.


00:24:36.106 --> 00:24:41.067
Well, I'm sorry, Alan. Nobody gets
